{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":52,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝的審判和恩惠"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["以東人多益來告訴掃羅說：「大衛到了亞希米勒家。」那時，大衛作這訓誨詩，交與伶長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"勇士啊，你為何以作惡自誇？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝的慈愛是常存的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的舌頭邪惡詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像剃頭刀，快利傷人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你愛惡勝似愛善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又愛說謊，不愛說公義。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"詭詐的舌頭啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你愛說一切毀滅的話！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"上帝也要毀滅你，直到永遠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要把你拿去，從你的帳棚中抽出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從活人之地將你拔出。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"義人要看見而懼怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並要笑他，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：看哪，這就是那不以上帝為他力量的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只倚仗他豐富的財物，在邪惡上堅立自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"至於我，就像上帝殿中的青橄欖樹；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我永永遠遠倚靠上帝的慈愛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要稱謝你，直到永遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你行了這事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要在你聖民面前仰望你的名；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這名本為美好。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/52.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/53.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/51.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}